{"seq":1,"slug":"order-dispatch-grab-match","title":"派单/抢单实时匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/real-time-dispatch-bid/order-dispatch-grab-match","wordCount":1768,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"派单-抢单实时匹配\">派单/抢单实时匹配</h1><p>订单进入系统的第五百毫秒，如果还没有被推给任何一个司机，它就已经开始贬值了。买家在 App 里看着&quot;正在为你寻找骑手&quot;的转圈动画，每多一秒，取消的概率就上升一档。众包调度最难的地方在于：候选司机不是等在那里的执行者，而是会拒绝、会犹豫、会同时被多个平台争夺的自由个体。因此&quot;把单给谁&quot;这个问题，本质上是一次<strong>带拒绝概率的实时匹配</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指派与抢单是两种市场形态\">核心概念：指派与抢单是两种市场形态</h2><p>派单（dispatch）与抢单（grab / open pool）不是新旧关系，而是两种并行的市场形态，适用条件不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两种范式的适用边界\">两种范式的适用边界</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>系统指派（dispatch）</th>\n<th>开放抢单（grab）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>决策权</td>\n<td>平台决定给谁</td>\n<td>司机决定接哪个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优点</td>\n<td>全局最优、可强制保证时效</td>\n<td>司机体验好、无需解释、实现简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺点</td>\n<td>拒绝率高时反复重派</td>\n<td>冷门单无人接、热门单被抢占</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>时效敏感、时效承诺强的订单</td>\n<td>订单密度高、司机充足的热区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键指标</td>\n<td>接受率（acceptance rate）</td>\n<td>接单时延、剩余可见时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中几乎不存在纯指派或纯抢单的网络，主流做法是<strong>分层混合</strong>：高价值或时效敏感的订单走指派，普通订单进公共池；或者对高等级司机开放池的提前可见窗口（见 <a href=\"../crowd-courier-onboard/courier-tier-capacity-zone\">运力分层与服务区域</a> 中的 <code>pool_visibility_seconds</code>），让抢单本身带有优先级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"候选集从哪里来\">候选集从哪里来</h3><p>两种范式共用同一段前置逻辑：圈出候选司机。这步的输入是订单的取件点、当前时刻、以及运力状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单创建] --&gt; B[取件点 → H3 格子]&#10;  B --&gt; C[地理查询: 邻近格子的在线司机]&#10;  C --&gt; D{过滤}&#10;  D --&gt;|状态 != active| X1[排除]&#10;  D --&gt;|区域不覆盖| X2[排除]&#10;  D --&gt;|容量/品类不符| X3[排除]&#10;  D --&gt;|已完成单数达上限| X4[排除]&#10;  D --&gt; E[候选集]&#10;  E --&gt; F{订单类型}&#10;  F --&gt;|时效敏感| G[指派: 打分排序 → 逐级邀约]&#10;  F --&gt;|普通| H[入公共池: 按可见窗口开放]&#10;  G --&gt; I[接受/拒绝/超时]&#10;  I --&gt;|拒绝或超时| J[扩大圈层半径重试]&#10;  J --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[订单创建] --&gt; B[取件点 → H3 格子]\n  B --&gt; C[地理查询: 邻近格子的在线司机]\n  C --&gt; D{过滤}\n  D --&gt;|状态 != active| X1[排除]\n  D --&gt;|区域不覆盖| X2[排除]\n  D --&gt;|容量/品类不符| X3[排除]\n  D --&gt;|已完成单数达上限| X4[排除]\n  D --&gt; E[候选集]\n  E --&gt; F{订单类型}\n  F --&gt;|时效敏感| G[指派: 打分排序 → 逐级邀约]\n  F --&gt;|普通| H[入公共池: 按可见窗口开放]\n  G --&gt; I[接受/拒绝/超时]\n  I --&gt;|拒绝或超时| J[扩大圈层半径重试]\n  J --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"匹配打分-为什么距离不是唯一变量\">匹配打分：为什么距离不是唯一变量</h2><p>第一版实现通常只按直线距离排序，把单派给最近的司机。这个策略在司机充足时表现尚可，在司机稀缺时会快速恶化，因为它忽略了<strong>接受率</strong>——最近的司机可能正在别的平台接单、可能不熟悉这个方向、可能是刚上线还不适应的人。</p>\n<h3 id=\"打分的组成\">打分的组成</h3><p>一个可用的打分函数应由四类信号组成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score = w_d \\cdot f_{dist} + w_r \\cdot f_{route} + w_a \\cdot p_{accept} + w_q \\cdot f_{quality}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>f_dist</code> 是司机当前位置到取件点的距离衰减（越近越高），<code>f_route</code> 是&quot;接单后送货方向与司机当前朝向的夹角&quot;的匹配度，<code>p_accept</code> 是该司机对该类订单的历史接受概率，<code>f_quality</code> 是评级与妥投率的综合（见 <a href=\"../crowd-quality-settlement/courier-rating-incentive\">司机评级与奖惩</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"接受概率是一个需要被估计的量\">接受概率是一个需要被估计的量</h3><p><code>p_accept</code> 不能凭直觉设定，它应该由历史数据估计。最简单的做法是按 <code>(司机, 订单类型, 时段, 距离桶)</code> 做分层统计，取贝叶斯平滑后的比率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{accept} = \\frac{n_{accept} + \\alpha \\cdot \\bar{p}}{n_{total} + \\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是全平台的平均接受率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是先验强度（常见取值 5–20）。这个平滑的作用是防止新司机因样本极少而被误判——一个刚上线只收到 1 单且接了的人，不应该被打成 100% 接受率，那样他会垄断所有派单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发控制-一个订单不能被两个司机同时接\">并发控制：一个订单不能被两个司机同时接</h2><p>抢单模式最大的工程风险是<strong>超卖</strong>：两个司机几乎同时点击&quot;接单&quot;，如果服务端处理不当，订单会被两个司机持有，结果是其中一个白跑一趟。这类事故对司机的伤害远大于对平台——他会认为系统不可信，然后流失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用条件更新做原子抢占\">用条件更新做原子抢占</h3><p>关系数据库的原生方案是条件更新，它的原子性由行锁保证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE order_assignment&#10;SET courier_identity_id = $1,&#10;    assigned_at = now(),&#10;    state = &#39;assigned&#39;&#10;WHERE order_id = $2&#10;  AND state = &#39;open&#39;&#10;RETURNING assignment_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_assignment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> courier_identity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assigned_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assigned'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING assignment_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若影响行数为 0，说明订单已被别人抢走，客户端应收到&quot;手慢了&quot;的明确反馈而不是静默失败。这个模式的所有变体都基于同一个原则：<strong>把状态判断放进 WHERE 子句，而不是先查再改</strong>。先 <code>SELECT</code> 判断再 <code>UPDATE</code> 会留下一个竞态窗口，在高并发抢单下几乎必然触发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"抢占队列的另一种实现\">抢占队列的另一种实现</h3><p>当事务开销成为瓶颈时，可以改用 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 做候选行的非阻塞认领，这个机制正是为&quot;多消费者队列&quot;设计的（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-select.html\">PostgreSQL: SELECT</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;WITH candidate AS (&#10;  SELECT order_id FROM order_assignment&#10;  WHERE state = &#39;open&#39; AND zone_id = ANY($1)&#10;  ORDER BY created_at&#10;  FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED&#10;  LIMIT 1&#10;)&#10;UPDATE order_assignment a&#10;SET courier_identity_id = $2, state = &#39;assigned&#39;, assigned_at = now()&#10;FROM candidate c&#10;WHERE a.order_id = c.order_id&#10;RETURNING a.order_id;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_assignment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zone_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SKIP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCKED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_assignment a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> courier_identity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assigned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, assigned_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidate c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>文档明确提醒：跳过已锁行会给出不一致的数据视图，因此<strong>不适用于通用查询</strong>，只适用于队列式场景——这里的用法恰好合规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"邀约的超时与逐级扩圈\">邀约的超时与逐级扩圈</h2><p>指派模式下，一次派单请求发出后有三种结局：接受、拒绝、超时。超时是最需要小心处理的，因为它的语义是&quot;结果未知&quot;——司机可能正在点接受，而你的超时计时已经触发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等的超时处理\">幂等的超时处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 超时处理：仅当仍处于 pending 且未被接受时才回退&#10;UPDATE dispatch_offer&#10;SET state = &#39;expired&#39;&#10;WHERE offer_id = $1&#10;  AND state = &#39;pending&#39;&#10;RETURNING offer_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 超时处理：仅当仍处于 pending 且未被接受时才回退</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispatch_offer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expired'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING offer_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若影响行数为 0，说明这条邀约已经被接受或已被处理，超时任务应当放弃而不是继续推进——否则会出现&quot;订单已经派出去但又被重新派给别人&quot;的双派。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扩圈策略\">扩圈策略</h3><p>一次派单无人接受时，系统应扩大搜索范围重试。扩圈的关键参数有三个：<strong>半径增量</strong>、<strong>重试间隔</strong>、<strong>最大圈层数</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轮次</th>\n<th>搜索半径</th>\n<th>邀约人数</th>\n<th>超时窗口</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1 格邻域</td>\n<td>1 人</td>\n<td>15 s</td>\n<td>最近且最可能接受的人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2 格邻域</td>\n<td>3 人并发</td>\n<td>20 s</td>\n<td>并发邀约提高命中率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4 格邻域</td>\n<td>5 人并发</td>\n<td>25 s</td>\n<td>开始牺牲距离换确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>区域全境</td>\n<td>入公共池</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>兜底：让愿意接的人自己来</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的每一行都是一次策略选择，而不是常数。<strong>半径增量的代价是接单司机的到场时间变长</strong>，因此扩圈必须与订单的时效承诺联动：时效宽裕的订单可以慢慢扩，时效紧张的订单应该更早并发邀约、更早提价（见 <a href=\"dynamic-pricing-surge\">动态定价与高峰激励</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指派与抢单是两种并行范式，各有适用边界；主流做法是分层混合，用&quot;公共池提前可见窗口&quot;让抢单天然带优先级。</li>\n<li>两种范式共用同一段候选集查询：地理圈选 → 状态/区域/容量/单量过滤，过滤条件直接来自准入与分层章定义的字段。</li>\n<li>匹配打分至少包含距离、方向、接受概率、质量四类信号；接受概率应用贝叶斯平滑估计，避免新司机被样本噪声误判。</li>\n<li>抢单的并发控制必须用条件更新（把状态判断放进 WHERE）或 <code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code>，绝不能先查再改。</li>\n<li>超时处理必须幂等：仅当邀约仍为 pending 时才回退，否则会造成双派。</li>\n<li>扩圈策略的半径、人数、超时窗口是策略参数而非常数，需与订单时效承诺联动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"派单/抢单实时匹配","id":"派单-抢单实时匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：指派与抢单是两种市场形态","id":"核心概念-指派与抢单是两种市场形态"},{"level":3,"text":"两种范式的适用边界","id":"两种范式的适用边界"},{"level":3,"text":"候选集从哪里来","id":"候选集从哪里来"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配打分：为什么距离不是唯一变量","id":"匹配打分-为什么距离不是唯一变量"},{"level":3,"text":"打分的组成","id":"打分的组成"},{"level":3,"text":"接受概率是一个需要被估计的量","id":"接受概率是一个需要被估计的量"},{"level":2,"text":"并发控制：一个订单不能被两个司机同时接","id":"并发控制-一个订单不能被两个司机同时接"},{"level":3,"text":"用条件更新做原子抢占","id":"用条件更新做原子抢占"},{"level":3,"text":"抢占队列的另一种实现","id":"抢占队列的另一种实现"},{"level":2,"text":"邀约的超时与逐级扩圈","id":"邀约的超时与逐级扩圈"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等的超时处理","id":"幂等的超时处理"},{"level":3,"text":"扩圈策略","id":"扩圈策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"背景审查与培训上岗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/crowd-courier-onboard/background-check-training"},"next":{"title":"顺路派送与订单聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/real-time-dispatch-bid/along-route-batching"}}